+/*
+ * Battery temperature, as reported by the fuel gauge monitor output.
+ * Downstream s2mu005_get_temperature(): the value is a 16-bit two's
+ * complement number in 1/256 degrees Celsius; POWER_SUPPLY_PROP_TEMP is
